Add Git dependency from GitHub

[2msdm[22m [32mgithub[39m <name> <author>/<repo> [<ref> [<dir>]] [-p <profile>]

name           Dependency name
author         GitHub source author
repo           GitHub source repository
ref            Branch name/tag name/committish to use
dir            Sub-directory in the git repo where the code is located

-p <profile>   Specify the working profile